cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "NMR Analyzer"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lim
    given-names: Jongsu
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3395-1484"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jongsu-king/nmr-analyzer"
url: "https://github.com/jongsu-king/nmr-analyzer"
abstract: >-
  A desktop application for inspecting and quantifying 1D and 2D NMR spectra.
  Reads Bruker, ACD/Labs .esp and JCAMP-DX data; processes raw free induction
  decays; and provides peak picking, integration, multiplet analysis,
  pseudo-Voigt deconvolution, contour display and a structure-versus-integral
  consistency check. Implemented against the Python standard library alone.
keywords:
  - NMR
  - spectroscopy
  - analytical chemistry
  - JCAMP-DX
  - Bruker
  - Python
license: MIT
version: 1.5.0
date-released: "2026-08-06"
